# The most CPU instructions each hot path's in-process work may execute,
# counted by callgrind (scripts/perf/instructions.sh, #2003): one line per
# path, as `<path> <ceiling>`, each the Linux CI count plus 2%. A ceiling is
# lowered in a normal change and raised only with its cause stated in the
# pull request; `report` measures a path without judging it.
aql_rewrite report
merge report
